# PostgreSQL adaptation inventory: path, bucket, purpose.
# The classified AllocSet patch is counted against aset-sublet.patch.classes.
# ABI patches are separate from the Sublet allocator delta.
shared/a11trace.h                                  glue       the record format, shared with the recorder in the paper repository
sublet/pg_subpool.h                                glue       what the manager needs from the level below
capstone/domain/backing-allocator.c                glue       first-fit backing allocator for the spatial arm
sublet/context-pools.c                             glue       revocable subpools and out-of-band metadata for the Sublet arm
sublet/unsupported-allocators.c                    glue       reject unsupported backing requests from non-AllocSet managers
capstone/domain/string.c                           compat     the string functions a freestanding build leaves undefined
capstone/domain/printf.c                           compat     the formatting the manager calls and a domain has no libc for
native/replay/printf.c                             compat     the same formatting on the host side
shared/postgres-compat.c                           compat     backend error reporting and process-state compatibility
capstone/include/ctype.h                           compat     a header the freestanding build needs to exist and not to do anything
capstone/include/errno.h                           compat     the same
capstone/include/locale.h                          compat     the same
capstone/include/math.h                            compat     the same
capstone/include/setjmp.h                          compat     the same
capstone/include/signal.h                          compat     the same
capstone/include/stdio.h                           compat     the same
capstone/include/stdlib.h                          compat     the same
capstone/include/string.h                          compat     the same
capstone/include/strings.h                         compat     the same
capstone/include/sys/types.h                       compat     the same
capstone/linux-host/domain-loader.c                test       the guest that creates the domain and sizes its regions
native/replay/main.c                               test       the replay driver
capstone/domain/replay-spatial.c                   test       the same in a domain
sublet/replay.c                                    test       the same under the discipline
security-tests/capstone/subpool-lifetimes.c        test       the level below's own test
security-tests/capstone/context-hierarchy.c        test       the context tree's own test, an ancestor withdrawing from levels never asked
patches/aset-sublet.patch                          allocator  the classified patch, counted by port-effort.py
shared/replay-engine.c                             test       shared trace dispatch and payload checks
shared/replay-engine.h                             test       native/domain replay interface
capstone/domain/domain-runtime.c                   test       domain entry, exit and replay scratch support
capstone/domain/domain-runtime.h                   test       domain runtime interface
patches/aset-capstone.patch                        compat     capability ABI alignment and minimum size class
patches/memorychunk-capstone.patch                 compat     capability ABI chunk header
patches/memorychunk-sublet.patch                   allocator  indices for out-of-band chunk and block metadata
